Cell["\<\
Embedded circuit specifications can be imported from a JSON file. The \
following creates two distinct instances based on the same specification. \
Hyperparameters of the embedded circuit are automatically rescaled to match \
the embedding circuit.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"23c47b16-9d87-4bed-9748-8406b96956fd"],

